# Files prettier must not touch.
#
# src/gen IS GENERATED. `buf generate` rewrites it from the .proto on every proto change, so formatting it here
# would be undone by the next generation — and editing it by hand is worse, because the next generation silently
# discards the edit. It is checked in so the build does not need `buf`, and it is left exactly as the generator wrote
# it.
src/gen

# dist IS OUTPUT. Formatting a build artifact changes nothing a reader sees and rewrites thousands of lines.
dist

node_modules

# The lockfile is npm's to write; reformatting it only creates a conflict with `npm install`.
package-lock.json
